[91.574049, "o", ", \r\n289:    num_trials: int = 10,\r\n296:    Uses Triton's adaptive benchmarking with fixed time budgets (warmup=25ms, rep=100ms) [Triton do_bench default].\r\n299:    Note: num_warmup, num_trials, discard_first are ignored - included only for \r\n305:        num_warmup: (ignored) Triton controls warmup\r\n306:        num_trials: (ignored) Triton controls trial count  \r\n326:            warmup=25,\r\n336:    num_warmup: int = 3,\r\n337:    num_trials: int = 10,\r\n347:    to use num_warmup and num_trials that explicitly follows what user define here\r\n348:    instead of do_bench's version that computes how many times to run warmup and \r\n349:    profile based on total warmup and repetition time\r\n355:        num_warmup: Number of warmup iterations\r\n"]
