[900.628752, "o", "prep: 0.201 ms\r\nBM128 BN128 BK64 w8 s3 g8: 2.609 ms maxdiff 4.27e-05 ok=True\r\nBM128 BN128 BK64 w8 s4 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM256 BN128 BK64 w8 s3 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM128 BN256 BK64 w8 s3 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM128 BN128 BK128 w8 s3 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM256 BN128 BK32 w8 s4 g8: 2.639 ms maxdiff 4.27e-05 ok=True\r\nBM128 BN256 BK32 w8 s4 g8: 2.489 ms maxdiff 2.94e-01 ok=False\r\nBM128 BN128 BK64 w8 s5 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM64 BN256 BK64 w4 s4 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM128 BN64 BK64 w4 s4 g8: 3.557 ms maxdiff 4.27e-05 ok=True\r\nBM256 BN64 BK64 w8 s4 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nBM64 BN128 BK64 w4 s4 g8: 3.258 ms maxdiff 4.27e-05 ok=True\r\n"]
