[1068.697123, "o", "cublas fp16 mm 137GF: 0.7385600209236145 ms\r\nDUAL BM128 BN128 BK64 w8 s3 g8: 2.655 ms maxdiff 1.98e-05 ok=True\r\nDUAL BM128 BN128 BK64 w8 s4 g8: FAIL OutOfResources\r\nDUAL BM128 BN128 BK32 w8 s4 g8: 2.842 ms maxdiff 1.98e-05 ok=True\r\nDUAL BM64 BN128 BK64 w8 s4 g8: 12.185 ms maxdiff 1.98e-05 ok=True\r\nDUAL BM128 BN64 BK64 w8 s4 g8: 3.296 ms maxdiff 1.98e-05 ok=True\r\n"]
